# Trade Agreement Lifecycle

This scope computes the key dates governing the agreement's validity, including its entry into force, fixed expiry, and the deadline for denunciation.

```catala
declaration scope TradeAgreementLifecycle:
  input signature_date content date
  input notice_period content duration
  output effective_date content date
  output expiry_date content date
  output denunciation_deadline content date
```

## Entry into force

The agreement enters into force on the day of its signature.

```catala
scope TradeAgreementLifecycle:
  date round down
  definition effective_date equals signature_date
```

## Expiry

The agreement is applicable until 31 December 2006.

```catala
scope TradeAgreementLifecycle:
  definition expiry_date equals |2006-12-31|
```

## Denunciation deadline

The agreement comes to an end upon the expiry of the notice period given for denunciation.

```catala
scope TradeAgreementLifecycle:
  definition denunciation_deadline equals
    expiry_date - notice_period
```